      "description": "Make active polling visible.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-following\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 15-6l3 3M21 3v6h-6M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-15 6l-3-3M3 21v-6h6\"/></svg>Following</button>",
      "css": ".ds-following{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid #c1afe5;border-radius:6px;background:#eee7fb;color:#5435ac;font-size:11px;padding:9px 11px;cursor:pointer;}.ds-following:hover{color:var(--accent,#6344c5);}.ds-following:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a98eea;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-following{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Link from selected step context to all evidence.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-text-action\">View all evidence <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-text-action{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:var(--accent,#6344c5);font-size:12px;padding:9px 0;border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;}.ds-text-action:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;}.ds-text-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a98eea;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-text-action{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-search",
      "description": "Filter runs with a compact searchable field.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><input aria-label=\"Search runs\" placeholder=\"Search runs…\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid #d7d2db;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 10px;max-width:360px;min-height:40px;color:var(--muted,#66616b);}.ds-search input{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;width:100%;min-width:0;font-size:13px;outline:none;background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--ink,#29282d);caret-color:var(--accent,#6344c5);}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#66616b);}.ds-search:focus-within{border-color:var(--accent,#6344c5);outline:2px solid #bacff6;outline-offset:1px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-item-active",
      "description": "Horizontal navigation in the white product header.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-navigation\" aria-label=\"Dashboard\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-nav-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01\"/></svg>Run explorer <span>24</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01\"/></svg>Reliability</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-navigation{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--nav,#ffffff);padding:16px;width:auto;}.ds-nav-item{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;width:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 13px;border:0;border-radius:6px;text-align:left;color:#66616b;font-size:13px;background:none;cursor:pointer;}.ds-nav-item span{font-size:11px;background:#dcd0f4;color:#5435ac;padding:4px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:#f4f1f8;color:#6344c5;}.ds-nav-item.ds-nav-active{background:#eee7fb;color:#5435ac;font-weight:650;}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a98eea;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Failed Status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-failed",
      "description": "Pair recorded status colour with readable icon and label.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"m15 9-6 6m0-6 6 6\"/></svg>Failed</span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;gap:5px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;white-space:nowrap;background:var(--fail-wash,#fceef3);color:var(--fail,#b52e57);padding:5px 7px;border-radius:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Continuous Investigation Frame",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Joined warm ledger and white inspector with a shared outer border.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-frame\"><aside class=\"ds-ledger-pane\"><h2>Stored runs</h2><p>Select a run</p></aside><div class=\"ds-inspector-pane\"><h2>Execution trace</h2><p>Select a step to inspect its evidence.</p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-frame{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:330px minmax(0,1fr);border:1px solid #d7d2db;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#29282d);}.ds-ledger-pane{background:#fbfaf8;border-right:1px solid #d7d2db;padding:18px 20px;}.ds-inspector-pane{padding:24px 28px;}.ds-frame h2{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;}.ds-frame p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#66616b);}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-frame{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.ds-ledger-pane{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #d7d2db;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected Run",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "ledger-row-selected",
      "description": "Retain the run identity and timing while the inspector changes.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-ledger-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-run-name\"><strong>Checkout workflow</strong><span>commerce · chromium</span><div>Local run · 09:42</div></div><div class=\"ds-run-meta\"><span>Failed</span><span>6.42 s</span></div></button>",
      "css": ".ds-ledger-row{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;width:100%;padding:17px 18px;text-align:left;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf2;position:relative;min-height:100px;background:#ede6fa;cursor:pointer;}.ds-ledger-row:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:var(--accent,#6344c5);}.ds-ledger-row:hover{background:#f4f7fb;}.ds-run-name{flex:1;min-width:0;}.ds-run-name strong{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink,#29282d);line-height:1.45;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-run-name>span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#66616b);margin-top:4px;}.ds-run-name>div{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#66616b);margin-top:10px;}.ds-run-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:19px;align-items:flex-end;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#66616b);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-run-meta span:first-child{color:var(--fail,#b52e57);font-weight:550;}.ds-ledger-row:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a98eea;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-ledger-row{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Execution Waterfall",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "waterfall-row",
      "description": "Measured time lane with an event marker and selected step.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-waterfall-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-step-label\">03 Submit order</span><span class=\"ds-waterfall-track\"><span class=\"ds-waterfall-bar\"></span><i title=\"Recorded event\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-duration\">2.40 s</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-waterfall-row{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(200px,.95fr) minmax(190px,1.3fr) 65px;gap:14px;align-items:center;width:100%;text-align:left;border:0;border-radius:5px;padding:10px 7px;min-height:49px;background:#f9e6ef;cursor:pointer;}.ds-waterfall-row:hover{background:#f3f6fa;}.ds-step-label{font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink,#29282d);overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-waterfall-track{display:block;position:relative;height:20px;background:#f0f3f7;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;}.ds-waterfall-bar{position:absolute;left:20%;width:60%;top:5px;bottom:5px;border-radius:2px;background:#cb6985;min-width:2px;}.ds-waterfall-track i{position:absolute;left:72%;top:5px;bottom:5px;width:1px;background:#243b52;opacity:.6;}.ds-duration{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#66616b);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;}.ds-waterfall-row:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a98eea;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-waterfall-row{transition:none;}}@media(max-width:450px){.ds-waterfall-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 48px;}.ds-waterfall-track{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:2;margin:5px 0;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "History Instrument",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "history-instrument",
      "description": "Recorded durations in a plum instrument with mint passed bars and pink failed bars.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-history\"><header><h2>Recent run durations</h2><span>Passed · Failed</span></header><div class=\"ds-history-bars\"><button aria-label=\"Passed run, 1.6 seconds\"><span style=\"height:25%\"></span></button><button aria-label=\"Passed run, 3.8 seconds\"><span style=\"height:60%\"></span></button><button class=\"ds-history-failed ds-history-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Failed run, 6.4 seconds\"><span style=\"height:100%\"></span></button><button aria-label=\"Passed run, 2.6 seconds\"><span style=\"height:40%\"></span></button></div><footer><span>Earlier</span><span>Latest</span></footer></section>",
      "css": ".ds-history{font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;background:#332849;color:#fff;padding:23px 25px 18px;border-radius:11px;min-height:181px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;overflow:hidden;}.ds-history header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;}.ds-history h2{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:550;}.ds-history header>span,.ds-history footer{font-size:10px;color:#d3c8e3;}.ds-history-bars{height:70px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #78628f;}.ds-history-bars button{border:0;background:none;height:100%;flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;min-width:0;padding:0 1px;position:relative;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .18s ease;}.ds-history-bars button span{width:100%;min-height:8px;border-radius:2px 2px 0 0;background:#a8dacd;}.ds-history-bars button.ds-history-failed span{background:#eea4bf;}.ds-history-bars button:hover,.ds-history-bars .ds-history-selected{background:#665477;}.ds-history-selected:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;height:4px;width:4px;background:#fff;top:-8px;left:calc(50% - 2px);border-radius:50%;}.ds-history-bars button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a98eea;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-history footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:8px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-history-bars button{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Signal Desk",
    "overview": "RunLens is a signal desk for browser run investigation. Bricolage Grotesque gives the interface a clear product voice. A white horizontal header opens onto a warm grey workspace. Large confident headings sit above compact technical content.\n\nThe plum history instrument pairs mint and pink timing bars with recorded status. Violet carries actions and selection. The ledger and inspector share one continuous frame so runs, steps and evidence remain connected.\n\nThe identity uses an authored geometric vector mark and existing library icons. Images are real captured browser evidence and review screenshots. No generated imagery is part of the interface.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Locally served Bricolage Grotesque with a strong headline.",
      "White horizontal navigation and warm grey workspace.",
      "Plum history instrumentation with mint and pink bars.",
      "A continuous ledger and inspector frame.",
      "Measured timing with linked browser evidence."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Recorded State Rule",
        "body": "Outcome colours report stored status. Keep a visible label or accessible icon label alongside colour.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Continuous Frame Rule",
        "body": "Keep ledger and inspector joined. Use a divider and surface tone to define their roles.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the local Bricolage Grotesque font for the interface.",
      "Do use violet for actions and selected context.",
      "Do pair outcome colour with visible or accessible status labels.",
      "Do preserve recorded timing and linked step evidence.",
      "Do keep the ledger and inspector visually connected.",
      "Do honour keyboard focus and reduced motion."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't restore the blue sidebar or previous system font stack.",
      "Don't add decorative shadows to the investigation frame.",
      "Don't replace recorded artifacts with decorative imagery.",
      "Don't make filter labels or counts lighter than the filter-text token.",
      "Don't claim a specific code font that the CSS does not load."
    ]
  }
}
